			"notes": "**Changes since 1.0.0:**\n- Fixed a crash on newer Forge versions due to a mappings change.\n\nInstall alongside your current copy of Figura 0.1.5. Mod jars should be compatible with all versions that modloader is available for (except 1.16.5 on Fabric/Forge)\n\n## Again, 1.16.5 is not supported\nPre-release versions (1.21.5, 1.21.6) may or may not work. Use at your own risk.\n\nAdds `/figura badge` from the upcoming development versions of Figura to select one of the Pride Figura marks, or `/figura badge clear` to return to the standard one."
